# "This spell can't be countered" (CR 101.2): Bot2 pays UU (Island, Mox Sapphire) for Counterspell on Rending Volley, which
# does nothing, and Volley resolves and kills Wojek Investigator (white, toughness 4).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Rending Volley
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Wojek Investigator
Counterspell
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Wojek Investigator.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Rending Volley.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Wojek Investigator)
? Stack = Rending Volley
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Counterspell.Cast(Rending Volley)
? Stack = Counterspell; Rending Volley
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Rending Volley
Bot2.Battlefield.Wojek Investigator = (absent)
Bot2.Graveyard = Wojek Investigator; Counterspell
